    ``resource_count`` and ``names``: the canonical lowercase digest
    echoed verbatim, the resource ids in registration order each once,
    that list's length, and the resources' names deduplicated in
    registration order and echoed verbatim. Computed on the fly from the
    remaining registry and recorded nowhere; resource registration,
    querying, pagination and content validation keep their existing
    behavior.
